{"title":"Dune Sandlord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 8 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>54</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>44</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>1,120</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>1,068</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>1,049</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>66</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>45</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>54</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>44</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>1,120</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>1,068</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>1,049</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>66</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>45</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/abcec94ff0faa74ecb5d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/81048038864ef94443bc.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/6ba550470ec062873272.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/52ee43c88dcc9f493c16.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/13723dc70710f273edfc.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/a999fbaccc26c6bac513.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/abcec94ff0faa74ecb5d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 45 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 45 looted corpses, 250 recorded drops, 16,581 total, 25–195 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/45</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 24% of 45 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 47 total, 3–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb i